    <string name="clipboard_disclosure_title">Allow clipboard sync?</string>
    <string name="clipboard_disclosure">While open and connected, ClipSync reads clipboard text and images, encrypts them on your device and sends them to devices with your shared secret. Incoming items replace your clipboard.\n\nOptional background receiving continues with a notification. Anyone with your secret can receive transfers. The relay sees your IP address, room identifier and connection metadata.\n\nYou can stop sync and withdraw consent in Privacy and data.</string>
